                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>4</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14293853" author="dsetrakyan" created="Tue, 27 Jan 2015 17:36:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In Ignite project we should have a separate module for TPS called &lt;tt&gt;geospatial&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the ZIP release, we should have ignite-tps.jar which will have Ignite integration code for TPS. It should be under &lt;tt&gt;libs/optional/geospatial&lt;/tt&gt; folder together with TPS library and LGPL license.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14294658" author="cos" created="Wed, 28 Jan 2015 03:29:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;As I mentioned in the dev@: would it make sense to be totally paranoid and just have a script that will download (L)GPL libraries during the installation process, so user can make a choice to use these or otherwise?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14298526" author="dsetrakyan" created="Fri, 30 Jan 2015 11:48:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I frankly would like to avoid it. There is no LGPL libraries kept in the source tree, which is good. The installation right now is very simple -&amp;gt; unzip the file and that&apos;s it. I would not want to complicate it with extra installation scripts which would have to be tested on all the platforms.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14299780" author="ashutak" created="Sat, 31 Jan 2015 11:54:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Work log:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Ignite / Ignite Geospacial Indexing module was added to teamcity. See 
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;GeoSpatialIndexingTestSuite&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Current implementation (notes): &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;new jar: 
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;libs\optinal\ignite-geospatial\ignite-geospatial&amp;lt;ver&amp;gt;.jar&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;libs\optinal\ignite-geospatial\licenses&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; contains &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;apache-2.0.txt&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; and &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;jts-lgpl-license.txt&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; (without h2 license).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="14301361" author="yzhdanov" created="Mon, 2 Feb 2015 15:08:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;please move method for index instantiation to index spi and remove factory class&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14301767" author="yzhdanov" created="Mon, 2 Feb 2015 19:44:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;branch does not compile for me&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14638538" author="ashutak" created="Thu, 23 Jul 2015 09:17:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Compilation fixed.&lt;br/&gt;
Fix reviewed by Yakov and merged at ignite-sprint-1.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
